OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force 'inadequate' at
OL,4,Ainvestigating crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has been rated
OL,7,F"inadequate" at investigating crime by
OL,8,Finspectors who also raised concerns
OL,9,Fabout its ability to keep people safe.
OL,11,FThe latest Police Effectiveness,
OL,12,FEfficiency and Legitimacy (PEEL) report
OL,13,Ffound Gloucestershire Constabulary's
OL,14,Fperformance has "deteriorated" since
OL,15,Fits last inspection.
OL,17,FTemporary Chief Constable Maggie Blyth
OL,18,Fsaid she accepts the report's findings
OL,19,Fbut said they needed practical and
OL,20,Ffinancial help from the government to
OL,21,Fmake improvements, which had been
OL,22,F"repeatedly asked for".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
