OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force 'inadequate' at
OL,4,Ainvestigating crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Nelson, Police and Crime
OL,7,FCommissioner for Gloucestershire, said
OL,8,Fthe report was not pleasant to read but
OL,9,F"absolutely none of it is a surprise".
